==English==
{{wikipedia|Granule}}

===Etymology===
From the Latin [[granum|granulum]], little grain.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A tiny [[grain]], a small [[particle]].
# {{geology}} A [[fragment]] of [[rock]] etc., [[larger]] than a [[sand]] [[grain]] and [[smaller]] than a [[pebble]].
# {{astronomy}} a small [[mark]] in the [[photosphere]] of the [[sun]] caused by [[convection]] [[current]]s. See also [[Wikipedia:Granule (solar physics)]].

